# The audit form POSTs its JSON payload here.
# Create a Webhook node in n8n, copy the PRODUCTION url, and set this in
# Vercel under Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables, then redeploy.
#
# Until this is set the form falls back to opening a pre-filled email to
# clodsalvador.automations@gmail.com, so it is never a dead end.
VITE_N8N_AUDIT_WEBHOOK=
